{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Arvor de 2 à 5","Demain dès l'aube - enfin, quand il pourra - le cinéma Arvor déménagera ! D'ici là, le chemin est ardu et semé d'embuches. Les deux Corentin ont partagé 3 ans durant le quotidien de ce cinéma Art et essai vieux d'un demi-siècle et sont tombés sous le charme de ce lieu emblématique imprégné d'images. Peuplé d'êtres attachant(e)s, de chats espiègles et d'un chien sonore, Arvor de 2 à 5 convoque les souvenirs d'un monde qui s'efface et projette les rivages d'un autre qui se dessine.",[4,5],"urban","low rank employment",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":29,"media":31,"synopsis":34,"production":35,"characters":38,"roles":39,"awards":47,"tags":3},"Film","FR2022_157","fr2022-157-arvor-de-2-a-5",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2022-11-02",2022,"Documentary",[18,25],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":24},"Corentin Doucet","corentin-doucet",0,"Male identifying","France",[],{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":28},"Corentin Massiot","corentin-massiot",[],[30],"Documentary – Observational mode",{"posterUrl":32,"trailerUrl":33},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/254/219/252926/format_page/arvor-de-2-a-5.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x_6ZfNYnB40",{"native":2,"english":11},[36],{"country":23,"share":37},"Majority coproducer",[],[40,44],{"person":41,"role":43},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":42},[],"Director of the film",{"person":45,"role":43},{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":46},[],[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
